</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Just as I am, and waiting not</l><l>To rid my soul of one dark blot;</l><l>To Thee whose blood can cleanse each spot,</l><l>O Lamb of God, I come, I come!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Just as I am, though tossed about</l><l>With many a conflict, many a doubt;</l><l>Fightings within, and fears without,</l><l>O Lamb of God, I come, I come!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Just as I am, poor, wretched, blind;</l><l>Sight, riches, healing of the mind;</l><l>Yes, all I need, in Thee to find,</l><l>O Lamb of God, I come, I come!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Just as I am, Thou wilt receive,</l><l>Wilt welcome, pardon, cleanse, relieve;</l><l>Because Thy promise I believe,</l><l>O Lamb of God, I come, I come!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Just as I am, Thy love unknown</l><l>Has broken every barrier down;</l><l>Now, to be Thine, yea, Thine alone,</l><l>O Lamb of God, I come, I come!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
